        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dennis Roady, Vitaly Zdorovetskiy, Roman Atwood\n- Roles: YouTube personalities\n- Products: Natural Born Pranksters\n- Topics: Internet pranks, YouTube channels\n\nFacts:\n- Dennis Darrell Roady was born on June 6, 1983.\n- Vitaly Zdorovetskiy was born on March 8, 1992.\n- Dennis Roady is an American YouTube personality best known for Internet-posted pranks and for his association with Roman Atwood and Vitaly Zdorovetskiy.\n- Dennis Roady starred in the feature film \"Natural Born Pranksters.\"\n- Vitaly Zdorovetskiy, also known by the YouTube username VitalyzdTv, is a Russian-American YouTube personality.\n- As of December 2016, Vitaly Zdorovetskiy’s main YouTube channel had over 1.3 billion views and over 9.2 million subscribers.\n- As of December 2016, Vitaly Zdorovetskiy’s vlog channel had more than 250 million views and 1.9 million subscribers.",
